# exempt: the core of the one-shot `backfill_promoted_blobs` (promote-content-loss fix, this PR) -- same shape and same reviewer reasoning as `judgement_backfill.rs`/`reextract.rs` immediately above, so read either first. Never mounted on any request path and never reached from a worker (grep `promoted_blob_backfill::` -- the only callers in the crate are backend/src/bin/backfill_promoted_blobs.rs and backend/tests/promoted_blob_backfill_pg.rs). Its four direct-SQL tables (atoms, graphs, node_atoms, nodes) run PLAIN/unscoped on purpose: this tool walks every promoted atom across every graph/account in the database by design -- finding the rows a per-account boundary would hide is the entire point -- which is exactly the shape `tenancy::scope::begin_account_scoped` cannot express (there is no single account to scope a connection to). `promoted_blob_backfill::assert_policy_bypass` PROVES the connection bypasses RLS on `atoms` against pg_class/pg_roles before any work begins and REFUSES otherwise -- same preflight-not-trust discipline as `judgement_backfill::assert_policy_bypass`/`reextract::assert_policy_bypass`, with its own negative control (a throwaway NOBYPASSRLS role) in backend/tests/promoted_blob_backfill_pg.rs's `preflight_refuses_a_role_that_cannot_bypass_rls`. The only writes this file makes to the RLS-covered roster are `atoms.UPDATE content_blob_key` (only after the R2 object is confirmed uploaded -- see the module's own doc comment) and `jobs.INSERT` via `enqueue_native_derivation`/`enqueue` (jobs carries no RLS policy at all -- not on the 0083 roster); it never writes `nodes`/`node_atoms`/`graphs` themselves, reading them only to resolve each candidate's original source atom. `backend/src/bin/backfill_promoted_blobs.rs` (the thin wrapper) has its OWN entry directly below, as of the blanked-key PR: it gained one direct-SQL query of its own there (the zero-candidate corroboration count) and this gate detected it, which is why the older note here -- that the wrapper carries no direct SQL and cannot independently trip the gate -- no longer holds.
backend/src/promoted_blob_backfill.rs exempt
